    (¯`·._.·(¯`·._.· Global Layout  ·._.·´¯)·._.·´¯)

    This is the global layout that will be used to displayed most pages (less the error page)
    If you're creating your own template, remember there is no obligation to respect the current file flow of this template.
    This is different from the old LimeSurvey template engine, where you had to provide every one of the pstpl files.
    Here, you must have a file called main_layout.twig (called from SurveyRuntimeHelper::run() ).
    Other than that, you're free to organize your files and inclusions as you want.



    (¯`·._.·(¯`·._.· Bootstrap ·._.·´¯)·._.·´¯)

    LimeSurvey uses Bootstrap.
    See: https://getbootstrap.com

    This template is an instance of Bootswatch Theme Flatly.
    See: https://bootswatch.com/



    (¯`·._.·(¯`·._.· Twig Engine  ·._.·´¯)·._.·´¯)

    The template engine uses Twig.
    See: http://twig.sensiolabs.org/

    The main variable is aSurveyInfo. It's an array containing the main information about the survey.
    aSurveyInfo also contains other needed arrays, such as aNavigator, or aQuestionGroups (which contain aQuestions), etc.

    If you want to see what is availabe in aSurveyInfo, turn debug mode on in application/config.php, and copy the following line to the end of the <body> element below:
    {{ dump(aSurveyInfo) }}

    To echo a variable, just insert                      : {{ variable }}
    To translate a string, just insert                   : {{gT( string )}}

    NOTE: aSurveyInfo should be cleaned to remove the unnecessary data.


    (¯`·._.·(¯`·._.· Twig Engine: advanced  ·._.·´¯)·._.·´¯)

    For security reason, Twig is in a sandBox.
    About sandBox, see: http://twig.sensiolabs.org/doc/2.x/api.html#sandbox-extension

    Available functions/Object Methods are defined in internal.php: components => twigRenderer
    Eg:
         Functions : 'include', 'dump', 'flatEllipsizeText', 'getLanguageData', 'array_flip', 'array_intersect_key', 'registerPublicCssFile', 'getAllQuestionClasses', 'getShowqnumcode', 'intval'

         Methods   :
                    - CHtml::textfield() (and: form, link, emailField, beginForm, endForm, dropDownList,htmlButton)
                    - Survey::getAllLanguages()
                    - LSHttpRequest::getParam()

    If you need to add simple functions or static methods, just add them to internal.php.
    If you need to add complex process, use application/core/LS_Twig_Extension.php (more help/comments there)


    NOTE: Feel free to ask for functions, variables, etc, that you feel are missing - https://bugs.limesurvey.org/my_view_page.php
#}

<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="{{ aSurveyInfo.languagecode }}" dir="{{ aSurveyInfo.dir }}" class="{{ aSurveyInfo.languagecode }} dir-{{ aSurveyInfo.dir }} {{ aSurveyInfo.class.html }}" {{ aSurveyInfo.attr.html }}>
    {% block head %}
    {# Headers, metadata, etc #}
    {{ include('./subviews/header/head.twig') }}
    {% endblock %}
    <body class=" fruity {{ aSurveyInfo.class.body }} font-{{  aSurveyInfo.options.font }} lang-{{aSurveyInfo.languagecode}} {{aSurveyInfo.surveyformat}} {% if( aSurveyInfo.options.brandlogo == "on") %}brand-logo{%endif%}" {{ aSurveyInfo.attr.body }} >
    
    <nav class="skip-links" aria-label="Liens d’évitement">
      <a href="#main-content" class="skip-link">Aller au contenu principal</a>
      <a href="#a11y-toggle" class="skip-link">Aller aux options d’accessibilité</a>
    </nav>
     
        {# Notice if emcache is on or off, used by tests. #}
        {% if aSurveyInfo.emcache %}
            <span style="display: none;" id="__emcache_debug" value="on"></span>
        {% else %}
            <span style="display: none;" id="__emcache_debug" value="off"></span>
        {% endif %}

        
        <header role="banner">

            <div id="{{ aSurveyInfo.id.dynamicreload }}">
            {% block body %}

                {# Bootstrap Navigation Bar: the top menu #}
                {% block nav_bar %}
                    {{ include('./subviews/header/nav_bar.twig') }}
                {% endblock %}

               {# Barre accessibilité #}
                <div class="a11y-toolbar" id="a11y-toolbar" data-a11y-toolbar>
                  <button
                      id="a11y-toggle"
                      class="a11y-toggle a11y-toggle--icon"
                      type="button"
                      aria-expanded="false"
                      aria-controls="a11y-panel"
                      aria-label="Ouvrir les options d’accessibilité"
                    >
                    <span class="a11y-toggle__icon" aria-hidden="true">
                      <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false">
                        <circle cx="12" cy="5" r="2.2" fill="currentColor"></circle>
                        <path
                          d="M12 8.2v4.1m0 0 3.8-1.8m-3.8 1.8-3.8-1.8M12 12.3l-2.2 6.2m2.2-6.2 2.2 6.2"
                          stroke="currentColor"
                          stroke-width="1.9"
                          stroke-linecap="round"
                          stroke-linejoin="round"
                        ></path>
                      </svg>
                    </span>
                  </button>
                
                  <aside
                      id="a11y-panel"
                      class="a11y-panel"
                      aria-labelledby="a11y-panel-title"
                      role="region"
                      inert
                      data-a11y-hidden-tabstops="true"
                    >
                    <div class="a11y-panel__header">
                      <div class="a11y-panel__titlewrap">
                        <span class="a11y-panel__badge" aria-hidden="true">
                          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false">
                            <circle cx="12" cy="5" r="2.2" fill="currentColor"></circle>
                            <path
                              d="M12 8.2v4.1m0 0 3.8-1.8m-3.8 1.8-3.8-1.8M12 12.3l-2.2 6.2m2.2-6.2 2.2 6.2"
                              stroke="currentColor"
                              stroke-width="1.9"
                              stroke-linecap="round"
                              stroke-linejoin="round"
                            ></path>
                          </svg>
                        </span>
                
                        <div>
                          <h2 id="a11y-panel-title" class="a11y-panel__title">Confort de lecture</h2>
                          <p class="a11y-panel__subtitle">Personnalisez l’affichage selon vos besoins</p>
                        </div>
                      </div>
                
                      <button
                        type="button"
                        class="a11y-close"
                        data-a11y-close
                        tabindex="-1"
                        aria-label="Fermer les options d’accessibilité"
                      >
                        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false">
                          <path d="M6 6l12 12M18 6 6 18" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"></path>
                        </svg>
                      </button>
                    </div>
                
                    <div class="a11y-panel__body">
                
                      <section class="a11y-section" aria-labelledby="a11y-title-textsize">
                        <div class="a11y-section__head">
                          <span class="a11y-icon" aria-hidden="true">
                            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false">
                              <path
                                d="M5 18 9 8h.2L13 18m-6.1-2.7h4.2M14 18l3.2-10H19L22 18m-6-2.7h4"
                                stroke="currentColor"
                                stroke-width="1.8"
                                stroke-linecap="round"
                                stroke-linejoin="round"
                              ></path>
                            </svg>
                          </span>
                          <div>
                            <h3 id="a11y-title-textsize" class="a11y-section__title">Taille du texte</h3>
                            <p class="a11y-section__desc">Augmenter ou réduire la lecture</p>
                          </div>
                        </div>
                
                        <div class="a11y-inline-controls">
                          <button
                            type="button"
                            class="a11y-btn"
                            data-action="decrease-text"
                            tabindex="-1"
                            aria-label="A− - Réduire la taille du texte"
                          >
                            A−
                          </button>
                
                          <div
                            class="a11y-value"
                            data-a11y-font-label
                          >
                            100%
                          </div>
                
                          <button
                            type="button"
                            class="a11y-btn"
                            data-action="increase-text"
                            tabindex="-1"
                            aria-label="A+ - Augmenter la taille du texte"
                          >
                            A+
                          </button>
                        </div>
                      </section>
                
                      <section class="a11y-section" aria-labelledby="a11y-title-display">
                        <div class="a11y-section__head">
                          <span class="a11y-icon" aria-hidden="true">
                            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false">
                              <path
                                d="M3 12c2.6-4.2 5.7-6.3 9-6.3S18.4 7.8 21 12c-2.6 4.2-5.7 6.3-9 6.3S5.6 16.2 3 12Z"
                                stroke="currentColor"
                                stroke-width="1.8"
                              ></path>
                              <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="2.8" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8"></circle>
                            </svg>
                          </span>
                          <div>
                            <h3 id="a11y-title-display" class="a11y-section__title">Affichage</h3>
                            <p class="a11y-section__desc">Réglages visuels rapides</p>
                          </div>
                        </div>
                
                        <div class="a11y-toggle-grid">
                          <button type="button" class="a11y-option" data-action="toggle-contrast" aria-pressed="false" tabindex="-1">
                            <span class="a11y-option__icon" aria-hidden="true">
                              <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false">
                                <path d="M12 3a9 9 0 1 0 0 18V3Z" fill="currentColor"></path>
                                <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"></circle>
                              </svg>
                            </span>
                            <span class="a11y-option__text">
                              <strong>Contraste élevé</strong>
                              <small>Renforce les contrastes</small>
                            </span>
                          </button>
                
                          <button type="button" class="a11y-option" data-action="toggle-dyslexia" aria-pressed="false" tabindex="-1">
                            <span class="a11y-option__icon" aria-hidden="true">
                              <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false">
                                <path
                                  d="M6 6v12m0 0h8.2a3.8 3.8 0 0 0 0-7.6H6m0-4.4h7"
                                  stroke="currentColor"
                                  stroke-width="1.8"
                                  stroke-linecap="round"
                                  stroke-linejoin="round"
                                ></path>
                              </svg>
                            </span>
                            <span class="a11y-option__text">
                              <strong>Mode dyslexie</strong>
                              <small>Police plus lisible</small>
                            </span>
                          </button>

                          <button type="button" class="a11y-option" data-action="toggle-luciole" aria-pressed="false" tabindex="-1">
                            <span class="a11y-option__icon" aria-hidden="true">
                              <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false">
                                <path
                                  d="M5 18V6h7.2a3.2 3.2 0 0 1 0 6.4H5m9.2 5.6H19"
                                  stroke="currentColor"
                                  stroke-width="1.8"
                                  stroke-linecap="round"
                                  stroke-linejoin="round"
                                ></path>
                                <path
                                  d="M16.8 13.8 19 18"
                                  stroke="currentColor"
                                  stroke-width="1.8"
                                  stroke-linecap="round"
                                ></path>
                              </svg>
                            </span>
                            <span class="a11y-option__text">
                              <strong>Police Luciole</strong>
                              <small>Police pour les malvoyants</small>
                            </span>
                          </button>
                
                          <button type="button" class="a11y-option" data-action="toggle-grayscale" aria-pressed="false" tabindex="-1">
                            <span class="a11y-option__icon" aria-hidden="true">
                              <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false">
                                <rect x="4" y="6" width="16" height="12" rx="2.5" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8"></rect>
                                <path d="M9 6v12M15 6v12" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.4"></path>
                              </svg>
                            </span>
                            <span class="a11y-option__text">
                              <strong>Noir et blanc</strong>
                              <small>Réduit les distractions visuelles</small>
                            </span>
                          </button>
                
                          <button type="button" class="a11y-option" data-action="toggle-spacing" aria-pressed="false" tabindex="-1">
                            <span class="a11y-option__icon" aria-hidden="true">
                              <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false">
                                <path d="M6 7h12M6 12h12M6 17h12" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round"></path>
                                <path
                                  d="M3.5 4.5v5m0 0-1.5-1.5M3.5 9.5 5 8m15.5 5v5m0 0-1.5-1.5M20.5 18 22 16.5"
                                  stroke="currentColor"
                                  stroke-width="1.5"
                                  stroke-linecap="round"
                                  stroke-linejoin="round"
                                ></path>
                              </svg>
                            </span>
                            <span class="a11y-option__text">
                              <strong>Espacement augmenté</strong>
                              <small>Plus d’air entre les lignes</small>
                            </span>
                          </button>
                        </div>
                      </section>
                
                      <section class="a11y-section" aria-labelledby="a11y-title-reset">
                        <div class="a11y-section__head">
                          <span class="a11y-icon" aria-hidden="true">
                            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false">
                              <path
                                d="M4 12a8 8 0 1 0 2.3-5.7M4 4v4h4"
                                stroke="currentColor"
                                stroke-width="1.8"
                                stroke-linecap="round"
                                stroke-linejoin="round"
                              ></path>
                            </svg>
                          </span>
                          <div>
                            <h3 id="a11y-title-reset" class="a11y-section__title">Réinitialisation</h3>
                            <p class="a11y-section__desc">Revenir à l’affichage par défaut</p>
                          </div>
                        </div>
                
                        <button type="button" class="a11y-btn a11y-btn--primary" data-action="reset" tabindex="-1">
                          Réinitialiser les réglages
                        </button>
                      </section>
                
                    </div>
                  </aside>
                </div>
                {# Top Container: in this template, it contains only  #}
                {% block progress %}
                    {{ include('./subviews/header/progress_bar.twig') }}
                {% endblock %}
        </header>  
        <main id="main-content" role="main" tabindex="-1">


                <!-- Outer Frame Container -->
                {% block content %}
                    {#
                        Content depends on the action (survey, questions, register, assesments, submit, etc)
                        Action are in ./subviews/content/
                    #}
                    {% set sViewContent =  './subviews/content/' ~ aSurveyInfo.include_content ~ '.twig' %}
                    {% include './subviews/content/outerframe.twig' with {'include_content': sViewContent } %}
                {% endblock %}

                {# Bootstrap alert modal #}
                {{ include('./subviews/messages/bootstrap_alert_modal.twig') }}

                {# Basic ThemeScript options  #}
                {{ registerScript("BasicThemeScripts", "
                if(window.basicThemeScripts === undefined){ 
                    window.basicThemeScripts = new ThemeScripts(); 
                } 
                basicThemeScripts.initGlobal(); 
                ", "POS_END") }}

            {% endblock %}

        </main>
        {% block footer %}
            {{ include('./subviews/footer/footer.twig') }}
        {% endblock %}
        {% block pjaxend %}
            <div id="bottomScripts" class="script-container">
                <###end###>
            </div>
        {% endblock %}   

        {% block themescripts %}
            <script>
                window.basicThemeScripts.init();
            </script>
        {% endblock %}

<footer role="contentinfo">
  <p style="text-align:center;">
    <a href="https://www.univ-lille.fr" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" aria-label="Université de Lille - site officiel, nouvelle fenêtre">
      <img class="mr-3" alt="Université de Lille" src="https://identite.univ-lille.fr/fileadmin/user_upload/identite/Images/Logo.sans.baseline-Horizontal-RVB-Blanc.svg" style="
filter: invert(1);" width="85"></a>
    © Université de Lille - 
    <a href="https://enquetes-etablissement.univ-lille.fr/support-videos" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
      Utilisation &amp; support<span class="sr-only"> (nouvelle fenêtre)</span>
    </a><br />
    Notre système de formulaire a été optimisé, le 8 juin 2026, pour respecter les règles de l'accessibilité numérique (RGAA 4.1). 
    Si toutefois vous rencontrez des soucis, des points de blocage, n'hésitez pas à nous contacter : 
    <a href="mailto:support-limesurvey@univ-lille.fr">support-limesurvey@univ-lille.fr</a>
  </p>
</footer>
{{ registerScriptFile(templateResourceUrl('files/accessibilite.js') ~ '?v=2026-06-04-p3-maintenance', 'POS_END') }}
</body>
</html>
